om the wall when Aoki shot past to win the gold medal with another world record of 1:03.34. Beier held on for silver, with Gyarmati taking bronze. Deardurff closed quickly to take fourth, but she had dug too deep a hole for herself."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "SF"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "909"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/48601"} "Mayumi Aoki"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JPN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JPN.png"}] "JPN"]] [:td {} "1:04.00 (1 h4)"] [:td {} "1:04.11 (2 h2)"] [:td {} "1:03.34 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "787"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/47457"} "Roswitha Beier"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} "1:04.34 (2 h2)"] [:td {} "1:04.36 (2 h1)"] [:td {} "1:03.61 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/48100"} "Andrea Gyarmati"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/HUN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/HUN.png"}] "HUN"]] [:td {} "1:04.01 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "1:03.80 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "1:03.73 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "1962"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/51003"} "Deena Deardurff"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https:/